{
  "id": "ui_menu",
  "name": "ui_menu",
  "description": "Start-menu ROOT as a REAL canvas+widget tree (CANVAS-MIGRATION 2026-10; WAVE-3 2026-10-20): the root carries a screen-mode `canvas` component + the ui_menu_bind script, and every visual element is a CHILD WIDGET ENTITY (text / panel + rect). Edit a child's text.string / rect / panel colors in the inspector and the mounted menu follows live (engine renderer reconciles the overlay every frame). ROW ACTIONS are BUTTONS ON THE WIDGETS: a child named menu_row_<action> is an interactive panel (panel.interactive = true — engine WAVE-3 widget interaction seam) that carries the GENERIC ui_menu_row script with its action as the declared param (newbattle | settings | help) — script name + params are visible in the hierarchy + inspector; the engine dispatches a click on the row to the script's onPointerClick hook. The transparent #se-menu DOM hit layer is RETIRED. Its menu_row_<action>_label child carries the row text. The bind script writes LIVE values (version line, the store-composed New Battle label, open/closed visibility) into the widgets from window.__se.menuFeed; labels/colors/layout live ONLY on the entities.",
  "components": {
    "transform": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "z": 0 },
    "canvas": { "renderMode": "screen", "resolution": [1280, 720], "width": 8, "height": 4.5 },
    "scripts": [
      {
        "name": "ui_menu_bind",
        "params": {
          "liveLabelTemplate": "{label} ({players} players, {rounds} rounds)"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
